      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794643311738,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Later, hand-off to insurers and TPAs through NHCX, the government health-claims exchange (FHIR-based). claim.json is already shaped to map to it; no integration is built.\nPer the Build Guide the National Health Authority does not plan to build hospital-facing front-ends, which leaves room for a product like Covara.",
      "originalText": "Later, hand-off to insurers and TPAs through NHCX, the government health-claims exchange (FHIR-based). claim.json is already shaped to map to it; no integration is built.\nPer the Build Guide the National Health Authority does not plan to build hospital-facing front-ends, which leaves room for a product like Covara.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "e60",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 12,
      "index": "ay",
      "autoResize": true
    },
