      "text": "Measured on synthetic claims only (fields extracted correctly, low-cost model):  A 32/32   B 39/40   C 35/35   D (phone-photo scans) 32/33   ·   Hindi scan demo 18/18 checks.\nThe planted problems (amount mismatch, duplicate bill, missing prescription, room-rent cap, waiting period, name variant) were found. Not tested on real claims or real people.",
      "originalText": "Measured on synthetic claims only (fields extracted correctly, low-cost model):  A 32/32   B 39/40   C 35/35   D (phone-photo scans) 32/33   ·   Hindi scan demo 18/18 checks.\nThe planted problems (amount mismatch, duplicate bill, missing prescription, room-rent cap, waiting period, name variant) were found. Not tested on real claims or real people.",
