      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794643311738,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Login, per-user access control, audit trail, encryption review\n• DPDP: notice, consent, erasure and breach process under the final Rules\n• Data location: Claude is outside India; check vendor terms (training, retention, region)\n• IRDAI: broker and outsourcing rules for Paytm and any insurer partner\n• A native speaker to review the Hindi text\n• Accuracy testing on real, consented claims\n• Legal review of the 'not advice' wording",
      "originalText": "• Login, per-user access control, audit trail, encryption review\n• DPDP: notice, consent, erasure and breach process under the final Rules\n• Data location: Claude is outside India; check vendor terms (training, retention, region)\n• IRDAI: broker and outsourcing rules for Paytm and any insurer partner\n• A native speaker to review the Hindi text\n• Accuracy testing on real, consented claims\n• Legal review of the 'not advice' wording",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 15,
