      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794643311738,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Cashless: insurer decides within 1 hour, final within 3 hours.\nInsurers and TPAs should collect documents from hospitals,\nso lead with reimbursement and pre-submission checks.\n15-day reimbursement with interest: secondary source, confirm.",
