      "updated": 1794643311738,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Rules notified 13 Nov 2025, phased in.\nConsent managers: after 12 months (about now).\nMain duties after 18 months (about mid-May 2027): notice,\nconsent, safeguards, erasure, 72-hour breach report, transfers.",
      "originalText": "Rules notified 13 Nov 2025, phased in.\nConsent managers: after 12 months (about now).\nMain duties after 18 months (about mid-May 2027): notice,\nconsent, safeguards, erasure, 72-hour breach report, transfers.",
